OL,4,CEU leaders fail to bridge budget       
OL,5,Csplits as talks stall                  
OL,6,GEuropean Union (EU) leaders have       
OL,7,Gdeferred negotiations on its long-term 
OL,8,Gbudget after tensions surfaced over    
OL,9,Gthe bloc's spending priorities and aid 
OL,10,Gfor Ukraine.                           
OL,12,FTense talks on the 2028-34 budget      
OL,13,Fended after 12 hours on Thursday at a  
OL,14,Fsummit in Brussels, with some members  
OL,15,Fwalking out of negotiations that will  
OL,16,Fresume in December.                    
